p('To reproduce the results, run calculate.py, distant_case.py and supplement.py from analysis/disturbance_environment_research, and then build_findings.py, build_workbook.mjs and build_report.py. The exact commands for the current host and the pinned libraries are listed in the README of that directory. Source hashes and access failures are cached under tmp/disturbance_environment_research. The CSV and NPZ time histories are under data/disturbance_environment, and the scientific plots under figures/disturbance_environment.','SmallX')
